          "e": "Although it's our first meeting, I have long heard of you.",
          "note": "<b>久仰</b> (gau2 joeng5) \"I've heard a lot about you / your reputation precedes you\" — formal, used when finally meeting someone you've heard about. More elevated than everyday greetings; suits professional or networking contexts.",
